  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nP = 2 + √3, Q = 2 - √3 \n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a - b)(a + b) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nBy rationalization\n\nP/Q = (2 + √3)/(2 - √3) × (2 + √3)/(2 + √3) \n\n⇒ P/Q = (2 + √3)²/(2)²- (√3)²\n\n⇒ P/Q = (4 + 3 + 4√3)/(4 - 3)\n\n**∴ P/Q = (7 + 4√3)/1**",
